+// "Show their words in English letters" (D4): everyday Latin spelling
+// without diacritics, lowercase ASCII, e.g. नमस्ते "namaste", தமிழ்
+// "tamizh", বাংলা "bangla". Readable, not phonetically exact: the inherent
